相驚動，或恐不然。」時孝儀置酒，粲怒，以杯抵地曰：「賊已渡江，便逼宮闕，水陸俱斷，何暇有報；假令無敕，豈得自安？韋粲今日何情飲酒！」卽馳馬出，部分將發，會江州刺史當陽公大心遣使要粲，粲乃馳往見大心曰：「上游蕃鎮，江州去京最近，殿下情計，實宜在前；但中流任重，當須應接，不可闕鎮。今直且張聲勢，移鎮湓城，遣偏將賜隨，於事便足。」大心然之，遣中兵柳昕帥兵二千人隨粲。粲悉留家累於江州，以輕舸就路。至南州，粲外弟司州刺史柳仲禮亦帥步騎萬餘人至橫江，粲卽送糧仗贍給之，並散私金帛以賞其戰士。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-043-weican:p002:m0142"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[{"older_person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","younger_person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_AAA","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"assertion_id":"a-liang043-qian-xiaochuo","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_AAA","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-041","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother","source_id":"s-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother-ws1512987","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001","quote":"劉潛字孝儀，秘書監孝綽弟也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001:m0009"}]}],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[{"older_person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","younger_person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_AAA","operator":"lt","scope":"siblings","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"assertion_id":"a-liang043-qian-xiaochuo","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_AAA","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-041","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother","source_id":"s-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother-ws1512987","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001","quote":"劉潛字孝儀，秘書監孝綽弟也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001:m0009"}]}],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-041-liuqian-brother:p001","text":"劉潛字孝儀，秘書監孝綽弟也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"f